<title>MOROCCO: Arab fund loans Morocco $98.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Arab fund loans Morocco $98.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Arab Economic and Social Development Fund on Thursday granted Morocco two loans totalling 960 million dirhams loan ($98.9 million) for water and electricity projects, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>The loans, repayable over 22 years at an interest rate of 4.5 percent and periods of grace of five and six years, will go to building two dams southeast of Rabat.</p>
<p>($1 = 9.7 dirhams)</p>
